          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The 2026 Jeep Cherokee is powered by a 1.6L Full Hybrid Electric Vehicle (FHEV) powertrain that seamlessly blends electric and gasoline power. It delivers responsive performance with smooth transitions and improved fuel efficiency compared to a traditional combustion-only engine."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does the 2026 Jeep Cherokee have 4-wheel drive?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Both 2026 Jeep Cherokees shown on this page, Overland T7402 and 85th Anniversary Edition T7410, are 4x4 hybrids. Capability still varies by the exact unit. See that vehicle’s window sticker."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the difference between the Limited and Overland Cherokees?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "T7402 is the Overland 4x4 hybrid in Sting-Gray at a Final Price of $44,530. T7410 is the 85th Anniversary Edition 4x4 hybrid in Bright White at $41,929. For a Limited, check live new Cherokee inventory. Open each Vehicle Detail Page and window sticker for that unit’s equipment. Do not assume Limited features carry over to Overland or the other way around."
          }
        },
